  "name": "Zucchini and Tomato Gratin",
  "subtitle": "Golden zucchini layered with tomatoes, mozzarella, Parmesan, and basil",
  "description": "A simple Italian vegetable gratin with sautéed zucchini, ripe tomatoes, melted mozzarella, and a browned Parmesan topping.",
